    },
    "sourceText": "象曰：即鹿无虞，以纵禽也。君子舍之，往吝，穷也。",
    "canonicalText": "“即鹿无虞”，以从禽也。君子舍之，往吝穷也。",
    "referenceUrl": "https://zh.wikisource.org/w/index.php?title=%E5%91%A8%E6%98%93%2F%E5%B1%AF&oldid=10643482&variant=zh-hans",
